<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">FLP - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Flp</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bafilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA EMWA ABAFILIPI</para>
  <para style="h">AMARUBA EMWA ABAFILIPI</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARUBA EMWA ABAFILIPI<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abafilipi: Banya-Filipi; Bantu b’e Filipi.</char></note></para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Muli aga maruba Paolo anakavuga omunkwa bwenêne oku bakristu b’e Filipi mpu bamugwâsize oku malagîrire gâge.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Paolo na Timoteyo, bambali ba Kristu Yezu, oku batagatîfu boshi muli Kristu Yezu bali e Filipi, haguma na balungere n’abashamasi. <verse eid="PHP 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Kuli mwe engalo n’omurhûla gwa Larha Nnâmahanga na Nyakasane Yezu Kristu!<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omunkwa n’omusengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Ngasi kummukengêra, nnamvuge Nyamuzinda wâni omunkwa, <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>n’omu nsengero zâni zoshi, ngasi mango mmusengerera mweshi n’enshagali; <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>bulya mwantabîre omu kulumîza Emyanzi y’Akalembe kurhenga olusiku lurhanzi kuhika buno. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Nnamanyire oku owarhondêraga ogu mukolo mwinjà muli mwe, aguyûkiriza lwoshi, kuhika Olusiku lwa Kristu Yezu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Kushingânîne mmulongeze ntyo mweshi, bulya omu murhima gwâni mubà. Nêci, omu nkoba zâni n’omu kulwîra n’okuhamîriza Emyanzi y’Akalembe, mweshi kushangîra mushangîra enshôkano nahîrwe. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Nyamuzinda ye muhamîrizi wâni: mmuzigira mweshi n’omurhima gwa Kristu. <verse eid="PHP 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>N’eci nshenga c’eci: nti obuzigire bwinyu buyûshûke ngasi lusiku kulusha omu bumanye n’omu burhimanya, <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>lyo mukaz’ibona ebiri binjà kulusha, na ntyo mubè bacêse na bêru-kwêru kuhika Olusiku lwa Kristu, <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>munayunjule amakwânane g’obushinganyanya Yezu Kristu arhushobôzagya, oku irenge n’obukuze bwa Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emyanzi ya Paolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Bene wîrhu, nalonza mumanye oku emmanja zanyishagakwo zakwânîne Emyanzi y’Akalembe. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>Bulya omu bwâmi n’ahandi hoshi bakola bamanyire bwinjà oku ndi mubohe erhi Kristu orhuma, <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>na banji ba muli bene wîrhu bàyumvîrhe oburhwâli muli Nyakasane erhi nkoba zâni zirhuma, bacisêza bwenêne okulumîza Oluderho lwa Nnâmahanga buzira bwôba. <verse eid="PHP 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Ntahabiri oku baguma banakayigîriza Kristu n’omurhima gw’obuyâgalwa n’okulonz’ilushana, ci abandi bakujira n’omurhima nkana. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Abôla bakujira n’obuzigire, bulyâla bamanyire bwinjà oku omukolo gwâni kuli kulwîra Emyanzi y’Akale­mbè. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Ci abandi bôhe bayigîriza Kristu n’obulonza bw’okuciberamwo mirhwe ibiri, bakujira n’omurhima gw’obulyâlya, bulya balangalîre mpu banyûshûlira agandi malibuko omu nkoba zâni. <verse eid="PHP 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Ci okwo kurhi kwankanjira? Oku byankabà kwoshi, akabà n’omurhima gw’obulyâlya, akabà n’omurhima nkana, caziga Kristu amanyikane! Okwôla kwo kunsimîsize, kwo kwanashub’ikansîmîsa. <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>Bulya mmanyire oku ebyo byankwânana okucunguka, ensengero zinyu zirhumire n’oku burhabâle bw’Omûka gwa Yezu Kristu. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Co ncîkubagîre ecôla, co nanangalire: ntâko nankabulabula; ci mmanyire bwinjà, bunôla nkagandi mango goshi, oku nkalama erhi nkafà, Kristu akuzibwa omu mubiri gwâni. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Bulya Kristu ye kola kalamo kâni, na nkafà erhi bunguke. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Ci akabà okuyôrhana obuzîne mwo gunôla mubiri kwankarhuma njira omulimo gugwêrhe amakwânane, ntabwîni cici nankacîshoga. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Ntabwîni ciguma nalondôla muli ebyo bibiri: ncîfinjire okucîgendera nj’ibêra na Kristu, kwo kwankanabire kwinjà kulusha. <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>Ci kukwânîne mbêre omu mubiri erhi mwe murhuma. <verse eid="PHP 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>N’okwo nkuyêmîre: mmanyire bwinjà oku ntâje ngahi n’oku nabêra ninyu mweshi, lyo mujà embere munabone obusîme bw’obuyêmêre bwinyu; <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>na ntyo hano ngaluka ekarhî kinyu, mubone erindi igwârhiro ly’okucîkunga muli Kristu Yezu.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okulwîra obuyêmêre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Kwônene mubè n’olugendo lushingânîne Emyanzi y’Akalembe ya Kristu. Mbè nyishir’ibonana ninyu, mbè mbêzire kulî ninyu, nalonza nyumve oku haguma mulukira, n’oku omurhima gwinyu guli muguma omu kulwîra obuyêmêre bw’Emyanzi y’Akalembe; <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>oku murhakangwa ciru n’ehitya n’abashombanyi: eco co cimanyîso c’okubayêreka oku kuherêrekera bâherêrekere oku mwene mwâcira; n’eyo eri ngalo ya Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Bulya murhashobôlaga e­nshôkano y’okuyêmêra Kristu kwônene, ci n’ey’okubona amalibuko erhi ye rhuma. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/>Ninyu mudwîrhe mwalwa erya ntambala mwabonaga nalwa, na nk’oku mumanyire, ncidwîrhe nayilwa kuhika ene.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Okulanga ecinyabuguma omu bwîrhôhye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Akabà hali akantu kankalêrha oburhûlirize muli Kristu, akabà obuzigire bwakahash’ihira omuntu omurhima omu nda, akabà ecinyabuguma muli Mûka Mutagatîfu ho cibà, akabà habà olukogo n’obwonjo, <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>muhire ishwinjiro oku busîme bwâni omu kukalukira haguma: mubè na buzigire buguma, na murhima muguma, na nkengêro nguma. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Ntâco mujirage n’omurhima gw’okucîberûlamwo mirhwe ibiri erhi gw’okucîyêrekana oku murhali; ci ngasi muguma akagerêreza n’obwîrhôhye oku abâbo bamulushire. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Murhakâg’ilonza ngasi muguma obunguke bwâge yêne, ci ngasi muntu akâlonza obunguke bw’abandi. <verse eid="PHP 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Enkengêro z’emirhima yinyu zishushane n’ez’omurhima gwa Kristu Yezu.<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Yêhe, oku ali omu bwôrhere bwa Nyamuzinda, arhaderhaga mpu anacînanîrize oku bukulu bwâge bw’okuyumânana na Nyamuzinda;<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>ci acîjira busha, ayanka obwôrhere bw’omujà, erhi acîjira muntu. Akacîyêrekana nka muntu kwône omu bandi;<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>acîrhôhya yêne, abà mumvi kuhika okufà, afîra oku musalaba.<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Okwo kwo kwarhumire Nyamuzinda amukuza, amuhà Izîno lilushire agandi mazîno goshi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Izîno lilushire agandi mazîno goshi lyo izîno lya «Nyakasane»: kwo kuderha Mwâmi Mukulu w’abantu boshi n’ow’ebintu byoshi; kandi omulongo gwa 11: Yezu Kristu ye Nyakasane.</char></note>,<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>mpu ngasi oyumva izîno lya Yezu, akabà emalunga, akabà en’igulu, akabà omu kuzimu, afukame;<verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>na ngasi lulimi lulumîze oku Yezu Kristu ye Nyakasane, oku irenge lya Nyamuzinda Îshe.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucîhangana omu kukolera obucire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Ntyo, bîra bâni, kulyâla muyôrha munyumva, kwo munyumvagye, arhali amango ndi ekarhî kinyu lyône, ci bwenêne buno ntahali; mushibirire obucire bwinyu erhi munayôbohire munadwîrhe mwageramwo omusisi. <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>Bulya Nyamuzinda yênene ommuhà okulonza n’okujira ebi asîmire. <verse eid="PHP 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Muli byoshi mukole buzira kucîduduma na buzira kurhindira, <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/>lyo mubà bêru-kwêru na bacêse, mubè bâna ba Nyamuzinda barhalikwo izâbyo omu kâgarhî k’iburha libî n’ery’emihera; ekarhî k’ery’iburha kwo mulangashana nka rhumole omu igulu. <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>Mugwârhe buzibu oluderho lw’obuzîne, ly’Olusiku lwa Kristu nyish’icîkuza, bulya ntalibirhiraga busha ntanarhamiraga busha. <verse eid="PHP 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Mâshi ciru omukò gwâni gwankabulagwa oku nterekêro n’oku ntûlo y’obuyêmêre bwinyu, nsîmire nancîshinzire haguma ninyu mweshi. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Kwo na kwo, musîme munacîshinge haguma nâni.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obugo bwa Timoteyo bo n’Epafroditi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Nangalire muli Nyakasane Yezu nti nammurhumira Timoteyo duba, lyo manya emyanzi yinyu, na ntyo omurhima gubêre omu nda. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Bulya ntà wundi ngwêrhe ncîkubagira akâge, owankashîbirira obunguke bwinyu n’omurhima gwoshi. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Kali boshi banakalonza obunguke bwâbo bône, ci barhalwîra ebya Kristu! <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Murhahabiri oku ayêrekîne oburhwâli bwâge n’oku akozire nâni omukolo gw’okulumîza Emyanzi y’Akalembe nka kulya omwâna akola n’îshe. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Oyôla ye nangalire nti ye nammurhumira hano mbona lunda luhi ebyâni biyêrekîre. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Ciru nangalire muli Nyakasane oku nâni niene ntalegam’iyisha. <verse eid="PHP 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Ncîkêbirwe nti kukwânîne mmugalulire Epafroditi, oyu mwene wîrhu rhushangîra naye omulimo n’amatumu, ye muganda mwantumiraga mpu antabâle omu bulagîrire bwâni. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Ali akola ammuduzire mweshi, anali ababîre erhi amanya oku mwayumvirhe oku alwâla. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Nêci, kwo binali, ali alwâzire, ciru alonz’ifà. Ci Nyamuzinda amufà lukogo; ci mushâna arhali yênene alufîre, ci na nâni, mpu lyo ndek’ibona akarhinda oku kandi. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Y’oyo mmurhumirage duba, nti hano mumulolakwo, mushub’ishagaluka, na nâni niene akarhinda ka­mpwe emurhima. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Nêci, mumuyankirire n’omwîshingo muli Nyakasane, munakaz’ikenga abali akâge. <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>Bulya mukolo gwa Kristu gwarhumaga alinz’ifà, alonz’ihâna obuzîne bwâge, mpu oburhabâle murhankahashir’impisakwo, abumpè ahâli hinyu.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Enjira y’okuli y’obucire bw’omukristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Nêci, bene wîrhu, mucîshinge muli Nyakasane. Okushub’immuyandikira ebinarhanzir’immubwîra kurhantamya, na kuli mwe kugwêrhe akamalo. <verse eid="PHP 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Mumanye orhubwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">orhubwa: Ntyo kwo Abayahudi bakâg’iderha abapagani. Paolo naye abagalulire eco cijâci câbo!</char></note>! Mumanye abakozi babî! Mumanye abakembûle b’obwîhambe! <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Kali rhwe bakembûle b’okunali, rhwe rhushenga Nnâmahanga muli Mûka gwâge Mutagatîfu, n’obukuze bwîrhu muli Yezu Kristu rhubulongeza, ci rhurhacîkubagira mubiri. <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>N’obwo nâni nanahash’ibona igwârhiro y’okucîkubagira omubiri. N’akabà haligi owundi wankaderha mpu ankahash’icîkubagira omubiri, nie ono mulushire. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Nakembûlagwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lyàli irhegeko ly’Abayahudi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12, 3</ref></char>).</char></note> olusiku lwa kali munâni, ndi wa mulala gw’Israheli, w’omu bûko bwa Benyamini, ndi Muhabraniya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paolo aburhiragwa e Tarsi, ci olulimi lwâbo càli ciyahudi, co ciharamiya erhi cihabraniya.</char></note> okomoka oku Bahabraniya; oku biyêrekîre Amarhegeko, ndi Mufarizeyi; <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>rhukalola obushiru, nalibuzize Ekleziya; oku bushinganyanya bw’okushimba Amarhegeko, nali muntu munwererwa. <verse eid="PHP 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Ci obwo bunguke bwoshi nal’ingwêrhe, nabulola nka muhona erhi Kristu orhuma. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Nêci, mbwîne oku ebintu byoshi biri muhona nkalola obunguke burhajira Lugero bw’okumanya Kristu Yezu, Nnâhamwîrhu. Ye warhumire nyêmêra okuheza byoshi, nankola nkabilola nka bikabulirwa, nti lyo nyunguka Kristu <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>nnamubêmwo, arhali n’o­bwâni bushinganyanya, bulya burhenga omu kushimba amarhegeko, ci n’obushinganyanya burhenga omu kuyêmêra Kristu, bulya buhânwa na Nyamuzinda bunasimikira oku buyêmêre; <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>ntyo mmumanye yêne, manye n’obuhashe bw’obufûke bwâge, nshangîre n’amababale gâge, nnamushushe omu lufù lwâge, <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>Lyo mpash’iyish’ifûka omu bafîre. <verse eid="PHP 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Ntadesiri nti nkola mpisire nîsi nti nkola mbà mwimâna; ci ncikulikire enjira yâni, ndole erhi nankamushikira bu­lya nâni niene nagwârhagwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nagwârhagwa: Omu njira y’e Damasi.</char></note> na Yezu Kristu. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Nanga, bene wîrhu, ntadesiri nti nkola ngwêrhe. Ciguma cône ndesire: nyibagire enjira namâgenda, nyêrekîre nieshi nieshi embere zâni, <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>ndi bulibirha nti mpike, lyo mpâbwa oluhembo Nyamuzinda arhuhamagaliraga omu mpingu muli Kristu Yezu. <verse eid="PHP 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Rhweshi rhweshi rhwe rhukola rhuli bimâna, kwo rhukwânîne rhugerêreze ntyo; n’erhi ankabà haligi kundi mugerêrize, muli okwo nakwo Nyamuzinda a­mmumulekera obukengêre<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 2:6">1 Kor 2, 6</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Ci kwônene, ngasi aha rhwankabà rhuhisire, rhushimbe njira nguma.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>Mweshi muntolerekwo olwiganyo, bene wîrhu, munakalolakwo balya bashimba olwiganyo lwîrhu. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Bulya hali banji, -nammubwîzirekwo kanji, ci nashub’immubwîrakwo ene n’emirenge omu masù-, hali banji bayôrha nka bashombanyi b’omusalaba gwa Kristu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Abôla obuzinda bwâbo kuli kuhera, enda yâbo ye nyamuzinda wâbo, n’ebyankabalerhera enshonyi bwo bukuze bwâbo; barhanayishi ebirhali by’en’igulu. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Rhwêhe empingu yo mwîrhu, yo rhulinga oku Omuciza wîrhu Nyakasane Yezu Kristu ayish’irhuluka, <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>ayish’ihindula omubiri gwîrhu gw’obuzamba, agushushanye n’omubiri gwâge gw’irenge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ahindula omubiri gw’obuzamba gubè mubiri gw’irenge: Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 15:43-53">1 Kor 15, 43-53</ref></char>.</char></note>, bu­lya agwêrhe obuhashe oku bintu byoshi.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Ntyo bene wîrhu bazigirwa nkumbula, mwe busîme bwâni, mwe na ntanda yâni, mukomere muli Nyakasane, bîra bâni.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amahano mazinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Mpûnyire Evodiya bo na Sintiki nti bakaz’iyumvanya muli Nyakasane. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Nâwe Sizigo, murhabâzi wâni muzigirwa, nkuhûnyire obarhabâle; bulya bantabîre okulumîza Emyanzi y’Akalembe, bona Klementi n’abandi barhabâzi bâni. Amazîno gâbo gali mandike omu Citabu c’Obuzîne. <verse eid="PHP 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Mucîshinge muli Nyakasane ngasi mango. Nshubir’immubwîrakwo: mucîshinge. <verse eid="PHP 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Mucîyêrekane nfula omu masù g’abantu boshi. Nyakasane ali hôfi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Murharhanyagya cici; ci omu ngasi bulagîrire musengere Nnâmahanga, mumushenge, munamuvuge omunkwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Ntyo omurhûla gwa Nyamuzinda gulushire ngasi nkengêro gwalanga emirhima yinyu n’obukengêre bwinyu muli Kristu Yezu. <verse eid="PHP 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Ceci, bene wîrhu, ngasi biri by’okuli, ngasi biri nkana, ngasi bishingânîne, ngasi bicîre, ngasi bikwânîne okuzigirwa n’okukengwa, ngasi nkômedu nyinjà na ngasi kantu kakwânîne okukuzibwa, ebyôla byo mushîbirirage. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Ebi mwayigîrizibwe, ebi mwayankirîre, ebi mwayumvîrhe nammubwîra n’ebi mwabwîne najira, ebyôla byo mukâg’ikajira. Na ntyo Nyamuzinda w’obuholo anabà ninyu.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paolo avuga omunkwa oku burhabâle bamurhumiraga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Nasîmire bwenêne muli Nyakasane bulya mwayishir’ibona oku mwanshîbiramwo. Ntahabiri oku mwakâg’inyibuka, ci mwakabula obulyo. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Burhali bulagîrire burhumire nderha ebyo binwa bulya nakomerîre okusîma ngasi bwôrhere ndimo. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Nyish’ilamira omu bukenyi, nyish’ilamira n’omu buhirhi. Ngasi mango na muli byoshi nacikomerîze okuyîgurha n’okushalika, okubà mugale n’okubà mukenyi. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Nanahasha byoshi n’oburhabâle bw’Olya onzibuhya. <verse eid="PHP 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Ci kwônene mwajizire kwinjà erhi mushangîra amalibuko gâni. <verse eid="PHP 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>Ninyu mwêne murhakuhabiri, Bafilipi, oku erhi ntangira okulumîza Emyanzi y’Akalembe n’erhi ntenga e Macedoniya, ntà Ekleziya yantabîre n’eciderhwa lusaranga, arhali mwe mwêne. <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>Ciru n’erhi ndi e Tesalonika, kabiri kwoshi mwantumîre ebi nal’indagîrirekwo. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Kurhali kuderha oku nnonzize okuka­rhûlwa; ci nnonzize nti obunguke bwinyu buluge. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Bunôla ngwêrhe ebikwânîne byoshi, ciru na kulusha. Ndi muhirhi kurhenga erhi Epafroditi ampisakwo entûlo yinyu, ogwo mugavu gw’akasununu kinjinja, eyo nterekêro Nnâmahanga ayankirira anasîmîswa nayo. <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Naye Nyamuzinda wâni, omu bukuze bwâge, ammushobôze ngasi byoshi mukenyirekwo oku Lugero lunashingânîne obuhirhi bwâge, muli Kristu Yezu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Ayâgirwe oyo Larha Nyamuzinda emyâka n’emyâka! Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omusingo n’obwangà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Mulamuse ngasi Mutagatîfu muli Kristu Yezu. Bene wîrhu rhuli rhweshi bammulamusize. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Abatagatîfu boshi mpu asingi, ci bwenêne ab’omu mwa Sezari. <verse eid="PHP 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Enshôkano ya Nyakasane Yezu Kristu ebè omu mirhima yinyu!<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
